This is the RAMSES parameter file for the Dai & Woodward (1998) MHD shock tube test.
Compile the code with:
make NDIM=1 HYDRO=1 MHD=1 INIT=ALFVENWAVE

&RUN_PARAMS
hydro=.true.
/

&AMR_PARAMS 
levelmin=10
levelmax=10
ngridmax=10000
nexpand=1
boxlen=1.0
/

&INIT_PARAMS
A_ave=1
/

&OUTPUT_PARAMS
tout=1
/

&HYDRO_PARAMS
gamma=1.66666667
courant_factor=0.8
slope_type=2
riemann='hlld'
/



